Server init.
>> a := Blob xees: 4.
a bytes: ( Jokkalante xees ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob xees: 4.
b bytes: ( Jokkalante xees ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a xees.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
